# Paths that tools/check-refs.py may find mentioned in markdown without a matching file.
# One fnmatch pattern per line, matched against the repo-relative path. Keep this short:
# every entry needs a reason. Run `python3 tools/check-refs.py --list-unused-allow` to prune.

# Runtime files the v1 loop creates in a user's project; they are gitignored, so never tracked here.
.claude/loop.jsonl
.claude/metrics.jsonl
.claude/orchestrate.lock
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees
.claude/worktrees/

# Files that live in a user's project, not in the kit (the docs tell the user to create them).
docs/tech_spec.md
docs/features
docs/features/*
.claude/rules*

# Historical CHANGELOG entries naming files that were moved or renamed since.
docs/design/loop-engineering.md

# The v1 shell hooks, retired in 2.0.0: the migration docs name them as they sit in a v1 install.
.claude/hooks
.claude/hooks/
.claude/hooks/guard-git.sh
.claude/hooks/guard-main-edit.sh

# Human-committed evidence gate (IMP-1) and the baseline result files the human fills: absent in the kit repo by design.
docs/baseline/evidence.json
docs/baseline/results/run-N.json

# The hello-loop fixture's kit-overlay primers name files of the fixture project (the run's root), not the kit repo.
tests/helpers.py
tests/test_health.py
tests/test_migrate.py

# 0b-prose: files that live in a user's project, not in the kit.
.claude/launch.json
docs/domain-glossary.md

# 0b-prose: moved to .claude/context/choosing-your-stack.md (IMP-20). CHANGELOG entries are history.
docs/choosing-your-stack.md

# Probe harness (IMP-7): paths inside a scratch repo (tools/probes/files/ copies them there), the results file the
# human creates from the template.
.claude/probe/*
docs/design/probe-results.md

# 6-infra-ci and later: workflows a user installs from .claude/templates/ into their own .github/workflows/, and the
# policy file the infra CI templates read (all in the user's project, not in the kit repo).
.github/workflows/infra-*.yml
.github/workflows/label-guard.yml
.github/workflows/verify.yml
.claude/infra-policy.json

# 11a-bootstrap-ops: files /bootstrap writes in a user's project (never tracked in the kit repo).
.claude/bootstrap-receipt.json
.claude/bootstrap-receipt.json.lock
.claude/bootstrap/*
.claude/pr/

# 9-packaging: files the migration tooling creates in a user's project, and the retired v1 mode directory the migration notes name.
.claude/commands
.claude/commands/*
.claude/.migrate
.claude/.migrate/*
.claude/settings.json.pre-init
